classDiagram
    direction TB
    class Logger {
      +log(msg) void
      +warn(msg) void
      +error(msg) void
    }
    ServiceA --> Logger : logs to
    ServiceB --> Logger : logs to
    ServiceC ..> Logger : uses
    ServiceD o-- Logger : shares
    ServiceE *-- Logger : owns
    Logger <|-- FileLogger : is a
    Logger --> Sink : writes
